# Inputs at a sixth of the width from the axis excite no mode of order 2, 5, 8: two images appear at L_pi / 2 = 46.35 um.
# Reference: a 3 dB split near that length.
title 2x2 multimode interferometer at 1.1 of the 3 dB length
reference 2.8
grid dx=0.02 dz=0.25
window width=16 length=76
guide straight x=-1 width=1.2 from=0 to=10
guide straight x=0 width=6 from=10 to=61
guide straight x=1 width=1.2 from=61 to=76
guide straight x=-1 width=1.2 from=61 to=76
launch mode x=-1 width=1.2
monitor bar z=76 x=-1 width=1.2
monitor cross z=76 x=1 width=1.2
plane end z=76
expect power bar 0.283832912 2e-7
expect power cross 0.221306911 2e-7
expect total end 0.997010856 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.2415539 2e-6
expect radius end 5.3020129 2e-6
expect neff 2.824166898 2e-8
